  "factor_name": "Dispersion-Gated Beta-Neutral Residual Reversal (3-Day)",
  "version": "2029-10-04",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-sum_{k=0..2}(r_asset[t-k]-beta_60(asset,t)*r_equal_weight[t-k])/sd_60(asset) * clip(dispersion_t/mean20(dispersion),0,2)",
    "description": "For each tradable asset, estimate a trailing 60-day beta to the equal-weight cross-asset return, calculate the trailing 3-day beta-neutral residual return, reverse it, scale by trailing 60-day asset volatility, and gate magnitude by current cross-sectional dispersion relative to its 20-day mean. Signals use data through t and predict next-day return; t is the last completed day. Cross-section requires at least 8 valid assets."
  },
